        "q": "What risk levels does HealthKit attach to PHQ-9 and GAD-7 samples?",
        "a": "HKPHQ9Assessment.Risk has five cases: noneToMinimal, mild, moderate, moderatelySevere and severe. HKGAD7Assessment.Risk has four: noneToMinimal, mild, moderate and severe. Apple publishes no score thresholds for these cases. The risk property is read-only and the initializer does not take it, so the value comes from HealthKit's side. Show it as the questionnaire's screening band, never as a diagnosis or a recommendation."
